The ZIP file in which this READ.ME file is embedded, contains the following
files:

	READ     ME	This file

	MERGEED  ALS	The merge data file editor (alias of Data)
	MERGEPR  OPA	The mail-merge printer

	MERGEPR  TXT	The documentation (ASCII text)

        PICS     PIC    A necessary picture file. Put into \PIC\
        TEMPLATE MDB    A blank merge data file. Put into \DAT\MERGE\

	MERGEPR  DOC	The documentation in Word 5 format
	PSIWORDP STY	The accompanying stylesheet
	APPDESC  PCX
	MERGEED  PCX	Some pictures (only needed when printing mergepr.doc)
	MERGEPR  PCX
	OPENL    PCX

My only instructions are RTFM.

Known bugs are:

1.	You must run MergeEd before MergePr (make sense anyway).

2.	Serial printing doesn't work at all.

3.	Blank fields in the merge dara file cause blank lines in the
	standard letter.

4.	etc.




